        setup.alpha t.1 * γ *
          (setup.M + SOptLib.dualNorm η) ^ 2 /
            (2 * (1 + setup.mu * γ - setup.L * setup.alpha t.1 * γ))) :
    setup.Psi xBar - setup.Psi setup.xStar ≤
      (1 - setup.alpha t.1) *
